#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the IBM Cloud Resource Controller REST API to get, list, update, and create IBM Quantum Compute Service instances."
msgstr "Použij IBM Cloud Resource Controller REST API k získání, výpisu, aktualizaci a vytváření instancí IBM Quantum Compute Service."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use IBM Cloud Resource Controller API for instance management"
msgstr "Použití IBM Cloud Resource Controller API pro správu instancí"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "{/* cspell:ignore ResourceController  */}\n"
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore Abluemix, apikey */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore ResourceController  */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use IBM Cloud Resource Controller API for instance management {#use-ibm-cloud-resource-controller-api-for-instance-management}"
msgstr "Použití IBM Cloud Resource Controller API pro správu instancí {#use-ibm-cloud-resource-controller-api-for-instance-management}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use the IBM Cloud&reg; Resource Controller REST API to programmatically get, create, and update [instances](/guides/instances). \n"
msgstr "Můžeš použít IBM Cloud&reg; Resource Controller REST API k programovému získávání, vytváření a aktualizaci [instancí](/guides/instances). \n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "All Resource Controller endpoints require that you authenticate by passing a header called `Authorization` with the bearer token. Refer to the [REST API setup guide](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api).\n"
msgstr "Všechny koncové body Resource Controller vyžadují, abys se autentizoval/a předáním hlavičky nazvané `Authorization` s bearer tokenem. Podívej se na [průvodce nastavením REST API](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get an instance {#get-an-instance}"
msgstr "Získání instance {#get-an-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [`GET /v2/resource_instances/{crn}`](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#get-resource-instance) endpoint to get information about a particular instance. The [CRN](/guides/instances) must be URL-encoded in the path.\n"
msgstr "Použij koncový bod [`GET /v2/resource_instances/{crn}`](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#get-resource-instance) k získání informací o konkrétní instanci. [CRN](/guides/instances) musí být v cestě zakódováno pomocí URL kódování.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In addition to the standard Resource Controller fields, the response includes quantum-specific fields in both `parameters` and `extensions`. `extensions` stores the instance's normalized metadata, whereas `parameters` only stores the most recent request to modify the instance. Therefore, you should read from `extensions` rather than `parameters`.\n"
msgstr "Kromě standardních polí Resource Controller odpověď obsahuje pole specifická pro kvantové výpočty jak v `parameters`, tak v `extensions`. `extensions` uchovává normalizovaná metadata instance, zatímco `parameters` uchovává pouze poslední požadavek na úpravu instance. Proto bys měl/a číst z `extensions`, nikoli z `parameters`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `extensions` object includes these fields:\n"
msgstr "Objekt `extensions` obsahuje tato pole:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`instance_limit_seconds` — Integer, or `null`. The usage time limit for the instance. See [Set instance allocation limits](/guides/allocation-limits).\n"
msgstr "`instance_limit_seconds` — Celé číslo nebo `null`. Časový limit využití pro instanci. Viz [Nastavení limitů přidělení instance](/guides/allocation-limits).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage_allocation_seconds` — Integer, or `null`. The time allocated to this instance, used by the [fair-share scheduler](/guides/fair-share-scheduler) to determine queue priority. See [Set instance allocation limits](/guides/allocation-limits).\n"
msgstr "`usage_allocation_seconds` — Celé číslo nebo `null`. Čas přidělený této instanci, který používá [plánovač fair-share](/guides/fair-share-scheduler) k určení priority ve frontě. Viz [Nastavení limitů přidělení instance](/guides/allocation-limits).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`backends` — Array of strings. The allowlist of backend names available to this instance. `[\"ANY\"]` means all backends on the plan are available (the default). `[]` means no backends are available.\n"
msgstr "`backends` — Pole řetězců. Seznam povolených názvů Backend dostupných pro tuto instanci. `[\"ANY\"]` znamená, že jsou dostupné všechny Backend v rámci plánu (výchozí hodnota). `[]` znamená, že nejsou dostupné žádné Backend.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"The backends field may be outdated\">\n"
"  The `backends` field in the `extensions` object may be outdated. This can happen when IBM Quantum Support changes your account in a way that impacts instances. For example, when a backend is removed from an account, it will update the `backends` for the instance, but that change is currently not yet reflected in the Resource Controller API.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Pole backends může být neaktuální\">\n"
"  Pole `backends` v objektu `extensions` může být neaktuální. To se může stát, když IBM Quantum Support změní tvůj účet způsobem, který ovlivňuje instance. Například když je Backend z účtu odebrán, aktualizuje se `backends` pro danou instanci, ale tato změna se v současnosti ještě neprojevuje v Resource Controller API.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Instead, the current workaround is to use the [IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest) with the [`GET /v1/backends`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest/tags/backends#tags__backends__operations__list_backends) endpoint. (Make sure that you set the `Service-CRN` header to your instance's CRN.)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"  Místo toho aktuální řešení spočívá v použití [IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest) s koncovým bodem [`GET /v1/backends`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest/tags/backends#tags__backends__operations__list_backends). (Ujisti se, že jsi nastavil/a hlavičku `Service-CRN` na CRN tvé instance.)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"curl\" label=\"cURL\">\n"
"    The CRN must be URL-encoded in the path. Replace each `:` with `%3A` and each `/` with `%2F`. For example, `crn:v1:bluemix:...` becomes `crn%3Av1%3Abluemix%3A...`.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"curl\" label=\"cURL\">\n"
"    CRN musí být v cestě zakódováno pomocí URL kódování. Nahraď každé `:` za `%3A` a každé `/` za `%2F`. Například `crn:v1:bluemix:...` se stane `crn%3Av1%3Abluemix%3A...`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    curl \\\n"
"      --request GET \\\n"
"      --url 'https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances/<YOUR_INSTANCE_CRN_URL_ENCODED>' \\\n"
"      --header 'Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_BEARER_TOKEN>'\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  <TabItem value=\"python\" label=\"Python\">\n"
msgstr "  <TabItem value=\"python\" label=\"Python\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    import urllib.parse\n"
"    import requests\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    crn = \"<YOUR_INSTANCE_CRN>\"\n"
"    # We use urllib.parse.quote to URL-encode the CRN.\n"
"    url = (\n"
"        \"https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances/\"\n"
"        + urllib.parse.quote(crn, safe=\"\")\n"
"    )\n"
msgstr ""
"    crn = \"<YOUR_INSTANCE_CRN>\"\n"
"    # Používáme urllib.parse.quote k URL kódování CRN.\n"
"    url = (\n"
"        \"https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances/\"\n"
"        + urllib.parse.quote(crn, safe=\"\")\n"
"    )\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    resp = requests.get(\n"
"        url,\n"
"        headers={\"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\"},\n"
"        timeout=30,\n"
"    )\n"
"    resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"    print(resp.json())\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"    resp = requests.get(\n"
"        url,\n"
"        headers={\"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\"},\n"
"        timeout=30,\n"
"    )\n"
"    resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"    print(resp.json())\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get a list of all instances {#get-a-list-of-all-instances}"
msgstr "Získání seznamu všech instancí {#get-a-list-of-all-instances}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [`GET /v2/resource_instances`](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#list-resource-instances) endpoint to get a list of all your instances. Set the `resource_id` query parameter to `b6049020-80f4-11eb-a0f7-e35ec9b4054f` to filter to IBM Quantum&reg; instances.\n"
msgstr "Použij koncový bod [`GET /v2/resource_instances`](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#list-resource-instances) k získání seznamu všech tvých instancí. Nastav parametr dotazu `resource_id` na `b6049020-80f4-11eb-a0f7-e35ec9b4054f`, abys filtroval/a pouze instance IBM Quantum&reg;.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your account has multiple plans and you want to filter by plan, set the `resource_plan_id` query parameter to one of the following values:\n"
msgstr "Pokud má tvůj účet více plánů a chceš filtrovat podle plánu, nastav parametr dotazu `resource_plan_id` na jednu z následujících hodnot:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Plan | `resource_plan_id` |\n"
"|------|---------------------|\n"
"| Premium | `7f666d17-7893-47d8-bf9d-2b2389fc4dfc` |\n"
"| Flex | `53bde9d3-cdbb-46f5-a98f-60ebcadf7260` |\n"
"| Pay-As-You-Go | `5304b575-3cff-4455-90dc-ae4367762093` |\n"
"| Open | `850b21a7-71de-4e53-9441-1abdd202f35d` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Plán | `resource_plan_id` |\n"
"|------|---------------------|\n"
"| Premium | `7f666d17-7893-47d8-bf9d-2b2389fc4dfc` |\n"
"| Flex | `53bde9d3-cdbb-46f5-a98f-60ebcadf7260` |\n"
"| Pay-As-You-Go | `5304b575-3cff-4455-90dc-ae4367762093` |\n"
"| Open | `850b21a7-71de-4e53-9441-1abdd202f35d` |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each result includes the same `extensions` field as described in [Get an instance](#get-an-instance).\n"
msgstr "Každý výsledek obsahuje stejné pole `extensions`, jak je popsáno v [Získání instance](#get-an-instance).\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"curl\" label=\"cURL\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"curl\" label=\"cURL\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    curl \\\n"
"      --request GET \\\n"
"      --url 'https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances?resource_id=b6049020-80f4-11eb-a0f7-e35ec9b4054f' \\\n"
"      --header 'Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_BEARER_TOKEN>'\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    import requests\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
